@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram

hide footbox
title US028 - To get the list of items on auction of a given publisher

actor Buyer
participant ":System" as System

Buyer -> System : **1** I want to get a list of items on auction of a given publisher
Buyer <-- System : **2** Which publisher?
Buyer -> System : **3** publisher

System --> Buyer : **4** List of items on auction of given publisher

@enduml